, also known as Kazordoon Corym Cave, is located under the King's Gulf between <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>. It can be reached via three entrances; the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> sewers (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32331,31841,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32331, 31841, 9)</a>), the <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a> cave in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Graveyard\">Carlin Graveyard</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32389,31811,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32389, 31811, 9)</a>) and one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a> outside <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32570,31877,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32570, 31877, 10)</a>). The <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Dragon%20Lair\">Carlin Dragon Lair</a> is located in the bottom of the cave.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\"><img alt=\"Rotworm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rotworm_efbfce.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworm</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">40</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">65</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">40 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" 